    "sub_name": "自動化工程實驗",
    "sub_ename": "AUTOMATION ENGINEERING LAB",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹針對自動化產線所使用之機械手臂進行操作、測試、量測及分析。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides an introduction to the robotics experiments including operation, test, measurement and analysis.\r\n",
